WEBVTT

00:07:23.856 --> 00:07:30.029
And by 1981, government is using
the power of eminent domain

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:34.825
to wipe out an entire
working-class neighborhood in Detroit

00:07:34.867 --> 00:07:37.953
just because GM
wants to build a factory there.

00:07:37.995 --> 00:07:42.124
That coddling continues
through the 2008 financial crisis,

00:07:42.166 --> 00:07:46.921
when GM received really quite a massive
bailout from the government.

00:07:47.463 --> 00:07:51.175
That's not market failure,
that's government failure.

00:07:51.217 --> 00:07:54.929
Market would have stripped GM
for parts a long time ago.

00:07:56.555 --> 00:07:58.307
Now let's talk about Facebook.

00:07:58.349 --> 00:07:59.600
Same deal, right?

00:07:59.642 --> 00:08:04.021
Sort of, wacky people trying something new
just to see if it'll work.